                <pb facs="0885" n="877" sameAs="frus:frus1940v04/pg877"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/15959</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-06-13">June 13, 1940</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In view of this apparently indiscriminate bombing of Chungking without reference
                    to military objectives, should we call it to the attention of the Japanese
                    Government?</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
